<p>Alright, this was a draft stored in the sandbox since last year. Thanks to those who had read it, like sirpudding, Univine etc. Now that it's the Year of the Rooster (since Janunary), now's the most optimal year to post an article involving chicken (meat).</p>
<p>Image credits are as follows:</p>
