<li>Image 1 from Wikimedia Commons (<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phd.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phd.jpg</a>) under CC BY-SA 3.0.</li>
<li>Image 2 was photographed by me, and I am placing it under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.</li>
</ul>
